  "question": {
    "text": "The mean of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math> distinct observations is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;and their variance is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>.</mo></math> If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> out of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math> observations are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the remaining two observations are:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>11</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>18</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>13</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>20</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the other two observations be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math>, then<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></math></p><p>Then, other two numbers are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>21</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, variance is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn></math>, therefore</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>49</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>21</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>94</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>21</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>21</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>221</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>21</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math></p><p>So, remaining two observations are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>11</mn></math>.</p>"
  }
